I get off the bus.
This is a big bus stop.
I look around.
But, I do not see the water.
Where is the walkway?
There is a fruit vendor by the roadside.
I walk to that shop.
I ask him the way.
"Excuse me, where is the walkway?" I ask.
He points his hand to the main road.
"Go straight on this road," he says.
"Go until the end of the road."
"From there, turn right."
"Straight, then right?" I ask.
"Yes, the walkway is there," he says.
"Thank you very much," I say.
He smiles.
I walk straight along that main road.
